config BR2_PACKAGE_GLINET_PANEL_UI
	bool "glinet-panel-ui"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_UCODE_MOD_LVGL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBUCI
	help
	  The front-panel interface for the GL.iNet BE10000 and BE14000:
	  a 320x240 DRM display with a capacitive touchscreen, written in
	  ucode against ucode-mod-lvgl.

	  An idle clock, then pages the user swipes between: traffic,
	  wireless, the networks and their switches, the radios, QR codes
	  to join them, the clients, the interfaces, the ports, the
	  system gauges, brightness and reboot.

	  Start it with /usr/bin/panel_ui.

	  https://github.com/blogic/glinet-panel-ui
